{"Title":"An Act amending the special act charter of the town of Northampton","BillNumber":"H4221","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"TJW1","Name":"Thomas P. Walsh","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TJW1","ResponseDate":"2023-12-18T10:02:43.72"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"TJW1","Name":"Thomas P. Walsh","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TJW1","ResponseDate":"2023-12-18T10:02:43.72"},{"Id":"L_S1","Name":"Lindsay N. Sabadosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_S1","ResponseDate":"2023-12-18T10:45:43.9066667"},{"Id":"JMC0","Name":"Joanne M. Comerford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JMC0","ResponseDate":"2023-08-16T10:41:58.1733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4221/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Substituted, on motion of Mr. Walsh of Peabody, for a bill with the same title (House, No. 4080).  December 18, 2023.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 1 of chapter 67 of the acts of 1984 is hereby amended by striking out the word “five” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- 7.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 5-1 of article 5 of section 1 of chapter 277 of the acts of 2012, as appearing in section 9 of chapter 40 of the acts of 2021, is hereby amended by striking out the word “Five” and inserting in place thereof the following word:- Seven.\r\n\tSECTION 3. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}